}16 \\\\ -20\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}v\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo we have $T(v)=\\frac{1}{4}v,$ and so the linear transformation $T$ is a dilation with scale factor $k=\\frac{1}{4}.$\n\nThe matrix that represents a dilation of scale factor $k$ is given by\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}k & 0 \\\\ 0 & k\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, the standard matrix of $T$ is\n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{4} & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\frac{1}{4}\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-159760/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "166cd7e4-5568-5769-8bc6-4ffc4ed8b508"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-159760"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-328222/field-1/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "b770bdcc-d568-5e91-8604-37b3a1f0b663" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-328222/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "ca7ab953-a3f0-5719-8098-be287ef77aa2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-328222/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "46036544-950c-5d41-a09b-4aaa11bad45c" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-328222/field-1/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer-field/choices ["q-328222/field-1/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" "q-328222/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-328222/field-2/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "49667612-ce2a-55dd-ade8-3afa2ff9884c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-328222/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "133d9bf7-1fb4-5c51-b96f-4624814